==History==
2024
*The Super Knight [[Cards|card]] was made available in the Super Welterweight Event on 30/9/2024.
*On 7/10/2024, the Super Knight was removed from the game.
2025
*On 27/1/2025, the Super Knight was readded to the game in the Super Cards Draft Event.
*On 3/2/2025, the Super Knight was removed from the game.

== Trivia ==
*The word "Knight" comes from the German "Knecht", meaning servant or vassal. Originally, knights were associated with mounted warriors, later being considered a class of lower nobility, until eventually, knighthood had become associated with the ideals of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chivalry chivalry], a code of conduct for the perfect courtly Christian warrior. Often, a knight was a vassal who served as an elite fighter or a bodyguard for a lord, with payment in the form of land holdings.
**The Super Knight is 1 of 20 [[cards]] associated with nobility, with the others being [[Knight]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Royal Giant]], [[Royal Delivery]], [[Tower Princess]], [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dark Prince]], [[Prince]], [[Raging Prince]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Princess]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Spirit Empress]], [[Dagger Duchess]], [[Royal Chef]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Skeleton King]], [[Archer Queen]], and the [[Little Prince]].
*From his description, it is implied that Super Knight and the [[Barbarians]] are distant cousins, due to their physical similarities, especially their mustaches and hair color. Coincidentally, both the Super Knight and Barbarians are voice acted by [https://www.imdb.com/name/nm1423395/ John Mondelli].
**However, in the Dutch language setting of the game, the Super Knight is said to be the Barbarian's nephew.
**According to John Mondelli, the Super Knight has a French accent.
**The [[Electro Wizard]] and the [[Lumberjack]] are also voice acted by John Mondelli.
*While not available as a character, the Super Knight's sounds, along with the Barbarians, [[Wizard]], and Dark Prince, are featured in the [https://beatstar.fandom.com/wiki/Clash_Royale_Theme Clash Royale Theme] [https://beatstar.fandom.com/wiki/Songs song] in Beatstar.
*When the Super Knight is defeated, his metallic sword falls to the ground. The other units that drop items upon death are the Knight, [[Rascals|Rascal Boy]], [[Mega Minion]], Dark Prince, [[Executioner]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Sparky]], [[Fisherman]], Golden Knight, and the Little Prince.

